WEBVTT

00:05:59.355 --> 00:06:03.025
Or we can step up and express
our love and appreciation

00:06:03.067 --> 00:06:04.735
while they're still here.

00:06:05.569 --> 00:06:10.324
And we can honor all those around us
who are very much alive.

00:06:12.243 --> 00:06:16.122
I call this intentional honoring
of others “Gracenotes”.

00:06:16.163 --> 00:06:18.290
And whether they’re written or spoken,

00:06:18.332 --> 00:06:21.293
they're this means of freely
and openly acknowledging

00:06:21.335 --> 00:06:23.712
someone's presence and gifts.

00:06:24.797 --> 00:06:28.801
I know in my bones that these sentiments
lessen the pain of grief

00:06:28.843 --> 00:06:30.803
and increase its grace.